1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Now we have a board, copy a similar board and sew it together.

2
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:39,000
In order to see the wrinkle effect more clearly, I lengthen the board below.

3
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,000
When the two long lines are sewed together, there is no wrinkle when it naturally falls.

4
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Unless there is an external force dragging or supporting a certain point.

5
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
But when the length of the two lines is the same,

6
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
because the long side board is more, it will pile up.

7
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000
The position along the sewing line is the most obvious.

8
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,000
The center point of the double-sided selection can be activated.

9
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:15,000
After that, it can be retracted or rotated with the center as the basis.

10
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:19,000
After retracting, the length of the sewing line is different.

11
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,000
After opening the simulation,

12
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,000
because the board above is frozen,

13
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,000
so it will not be deformed,

14
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:29,000
and the longer board will form a wrinkle because of the function of the sewing line.

15
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:33,000
The characteristic of this wrinkle is that there are a lot of wrinkles in the sewing line.

16
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:47,000
This rectangular board is also often used to show the edge of the clothing.

17
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,000
The particle strength will also affect the texture and effect of the wrinkle.

18
00:01:49,000 --> 00:02:01,000
The board is made up of a triangular grid.

19
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:03,000
The particle strength is the distance between the top of the grid,

20
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:06,000
so the smaller the particle strength, the more the grid surface.

21
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:09,000
So after reducing the particle strength,

22
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,000
the number of faces increases,

23
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:13,000
just like the increase in the number of lines of the curve,

24
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,000
it will become smoother.

25
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,000
The detail wrinkle appears.

26
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,000
This is the result.

27
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,000
Thank you for watching.

28
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:22,000
You have made a good change to the basic of the fabric.

29
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,000
In addition to the particle strength,

30
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:25,000
the simulation effect will be affected,

31
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:28,000
and the type of grid will also be affected.

32
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:31,000
In the menu in the right-hand corner,

33
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:34,000
you can select to convert the grid to a rectangular grid.

34
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:37,000
The fabric of the rectangular grid will be more flexible than the triangular grid,

35
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,000
and there are fewer uneven parts.

36
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:42,000
The rectangular grid is prioritized in the outer or inner line of the board.

37
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,000
This is the result.

38
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,000
Thank you for watching.

39
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:53,000
It is possible to arrange the grid from the outside line or the inside line, and then move to the middle position, and the layout may be more messy, so the fold of the panel is still not smooth.

40
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:02,000
In addition to the fact that the panel can be divided into four parts, it can also be remeshed.

41
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:09,000
After the panel is remeshed, the layout of the grid is organized according to the layout of the 2D window.

42
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:13,000
You can see that the layout of the grid is very, very neat.

43
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:18,000
After each change of the particle diameter, the reset grid will re-arrange once.

44
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:25,000
Therefore, you can see that if the panel is rotated or the shape itself is special, then the grid arrangement will be crooked.

45
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:28,000
This simulation will not work well.

46
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:32,000
If you just rotate and do not change the particle diameter, there will be no problem.

47
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:38,000
For rectangular panels, just rotate them to the level or value position.

48
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:42,000
Then change the particle diameter, and you will return to the original state.

49
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:56,000
After the simulation, you can see that although the particle diameter is 20, but because the grid arrangement is very neat, the fold area looks very smooth.

50
00:03:57,000 --> 00:04:00,000
You can see that the number of folds in the overall shape is no different.

51
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,000
The shape is also similar to the previous one.

52
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:07,000
However, the version of the reset grid is different from the default grid type, and its calculation will be larger.

53
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:11,000
So when the particle diameter is relatively small, such as 5 or below, there will be some lags.

54
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:14,000
The triangle shape also has its own length, which is stable.

55
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Sometimes we don't need to reduce the particle diameter for the entire panel, as long as the details are shown.

56
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:26,000
Select the grid brush tool, you can select some of the panels on the panel and divide the grid.

57
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:39,000
After dividing, the particle diameter of the grid becomes smaller, and the grid surface number increases.

58
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:43,000
You can see that some inconspicuous cracks have appeared before.

59
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:54,000
Once the division command is applied, if the overall particle diameter is reduced, the area of the division will be reduced equally.

60
00:04:55,000 --> 00:05:02,000
Generally speaking, when a part is divided, it will display in a special color.

61
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:08,000
If you can't see it from a certain perspective, you can zoom in or out to see it.

62
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:18,000
Select the right button to delete the division, and return to the normal grid layout.

63
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:25,000
For this kind of long and short gap, we can directly increase the width and length of the panel to increase the gap.

64
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:47,000
The same can be done for the vertical grid.

65
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:58,000
As you can see, the middle line of the grid is the horizontal line of the grid, and the horizontal line is the vertical line of the grid.

66
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:03,000
The vertical line of the grid is the horizontal line of the grid.

67
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:08,000
We can also make the grid larger.

